     A* SHN Provider/Contract File - This file will house the data    *
     A* sent by Synergy.  This file will contain only one batch, no   *
     A* history.  The data will be replaced with each batch sent by   *
     A* Synergy.                                                      *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Created on 04/28/2003 by c:62 for Project 10MBX               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A* Revisions:                                                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 07/06/04 c:62 Project 10MDT                                   *
     A*               Add Network Type flag                           *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 06/13/03 c:62 Project 10MBX                                   *
     A*               Add contract state                              *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(FSREFP)
     A          R PSG01                     TEXT('Prov/Contract File')
     A            SGFEIN         9A         TEXT('FEIN')
     A            SGID#         11A         TEXT('ID Number')
     A            SGNAME        60A         TEXT('Physician Name')
     A            SGFSN         30A         TEXT('Phys First Name')
     A            SGSPDS        50A         TEXT('Specialty Description')
     A            SGMAD1        40A         TEXT('Mailing Address 1')
     A            SGMAD2        40A         TEXT('Mailing Address 2')
     A            SGMCTY        30A         TEXT('Mailing City')
     A            SGMST          2A         TEXT('Mailing City')
     A            SGMZIP        10A         TEXT('Mailing Zip')
     A            SGBAD1        40A         TEXT('Billing Address 1')
     A            SGBAD2        40A         TEXT('Billing Address 2')
     A            SGBCTY        30A         TEXT('Billing City')
     A            SGBST          2A         TEXT('Billing State')
     A            SGBZIP        10A         TEXT('Billing Zip')
     A            SGPHN#        10A         TEXT('Office Number')
     A            SGNPCT         6A         TEXT('WC Schedule %')
     A            SGEFDT        10A         TEXT('Effective Date')
     A            SGCXDT        10A         TEXT('Canceled Date')
     A            SGSPCD        20A         TEXT('Specialty Code')
     A*** BEGIN ADD *** 06/13/03 **************************************
     A            SGCST          2A         TEXT('Contract State')
     A*** END   ADD *** 06/13/03 **************************************
     A*** BEGIN ADD *** 07/06/04 **************************************
     A            SGNTYP         1A         TEXT('Network Type')
     A*
     A*           Valid values:
     A*              "C" = % of Charge
     A*              " " = % of MRA
     A*
     A*** END   ADD *** 07/06/04 **************************************
